Error [jet.NonCAbiType]: `U64 String!` is not a C-compatible type for a foreign function parameter or return.
  --> tests/ui/cffi_result_direct_rejected.jet:4:26
    |
  4 |     load: fn(id: U64) -> U64 String! = "store_load"
    |                          ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Import` / `#Export` functions must use types with a stable C ABI at the edge.
 Fix: Use scalars, `String`, or a struct with C layout; pointers only through the gated tier.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3203
